WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.10 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Policy management and review

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Policies protect people only when they are current, owned and known.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Track version, owner, approver and next review.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Review yearly, after incidents and when laws change.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Link acknowledgements to onboarding; archive old versions.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Vanita Weavers Cooperative (Cooperative · member-owned, India)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Vanita: policies for members read aloud at the general meeting and shared as voice notes; register reviewed each April.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a policy register and review schedule.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
